{
  "schema": "lgpe-gamedata-v1",
  "format": "LGPE-message",
  "lines": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "id": "msg_main8120_ghost_01",
      "hash": "272f16ab9316fbdf",
      "flags": 4,
      "text": "AGATHA: I am Agatha of the Elite Four."
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "id": "msg_main8120_ghost_05",
      "hash": "272f12ab9316f513",
      "flags": 4,
      "text": "I hear Oak’s taken a lot of interest in you, child."
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "id": "msg_main8120_ghost_06",
      "hash": "272f13ab9316f6c6",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "That old duff was once tough and handsome.\\nBut that was decades ago.\\c\\nHe’s a shadow of his former self."
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "id": "msg_main8120_ghost_07",
      "hash": "272f14ab9316f879",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "Now he just wants to fiddle with his Pokédex.\\nHe’s a fool."
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "id": "msg_main8120_ghost_08",
      "hash": "272f1dab931707c4",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "Pokémon are for battling!"
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "id": "msg_main8120_ghost_09",
      "hash": "272f1eab93170977",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR TRNAME(0000)]! I’ll show you how a real\\nTrainer battles!"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "id": "msg_kikuko_01_p02_cave_d1403",
      "hash": "530a6af515faf3f3",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[~ 6]"
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "id": "msg_main8120_ghost_02",
      "hash": "272f17ab9316fd92",
      "flags": 4,
      "text": "AGATHA: You win!\\c\\nI see what the old duff sees in you now."
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "id": "msg_main8120_ghost_10",
      "hash": "27329bab931a13b5",
      "flags": 4,
      "text": "I have nothing else to say.\\nRun along now, child!"
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "id": "msg_main8120_ghost_03",
      "hash": "272f18ab9316ff45",
      "flags": 4,
      "text": "AGATHA: So, you’ve come!\\c\\nIt’s not in my character to lose over and over.\\nGive this battle everything you’ve got!"
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "id": "msg_main8120_ghost_04",
      "hash": "272f11ab9316f360",
      "flags": 4,
      "text": "AGATHA: Small wonder that old-timer’s taken\\nsuch an interest in you."
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "id": "msg_main8120_ghost_11",
      "hash": "27329aab931a1202",
      "flags": 4,
      "text": "Oak and I used to be good rivals, too, you know.\\nJust like you and [VAR TRNAME(0001)]."
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "id": "msg_main8120_ghost_12",
      "hash": "273299ab931a104f",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "Well, what are you waiting for?\\nHead on to the next room!"
    }
  ],
  "unpaired_labels": [
    {
      "id": "msg_main_event_8120_max",
      "hash": "156e1c833bda91e6"
    }
  ]
}
